pipeline, the lobby/backend integration, the remote map-sync mechanism, the
Stream Deck configuration generator and the auto-updater; replacement of the
remote map catalogue with maps shipped inside the application; and adaptation
of the user interface, map catalogue and hotkeys for "Halloween: The Game".

